          },
          "description": "A gentle bedtime journey through a peaceful castle, where every room prepares for sleep. With calming sound effects, soft storytelling, and lullaby-style songs, this audio helps kids wind down. Meet kind characters like a sleepy unicorn and dragon, and drift off to the soothing lullaby “Lavender’s Blue.” Each room brings a new moment of magic, stillness, and comfort. Perfect for helping little ones feel safe, cozy, and ready to dream.",
